    {
      "text": "Joseph of Arimathæa … waited for the kingdom of God, Mark 15:43 (Luke 23:51). Simeon … waiting for the consolation of Israel, Luke 2:25. yourselves like unto men that wait for their lord, Luke 12:36. wait for the promise of the Father, Acts 1:4. we ourselves groan … waiting for the adoption, Rom. 8:23. waiting for the coming of our Lord, 1 Cor. 1:7. wait for the hope of righteousness, Gal. 5:5. wait for his Son from heaven, 1 Thes. 1:10. Lord direct your hearts … into the patient waiting for Christ, 2 Thes. 3:5. longsuffering of God waited in the days of Noah, 1 Pet. 3:20 (D&C 138:9; 138:28).",
